**Policy Updates:**
This Device Fingerprinting Policy was last updated on {{LAST_UPDATED}}. We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Material changes will be communicated through {{NOTIFICATION_METHOD}}.

**Contact Information:**
For questions about our device fingerprinting practices:

• Email: {{CONTACT_EMAIL}}
• Address: {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}
• Phone: {{CONTACT_PHONE}}
• Privacy Portal: {{PRIVACY_URL}}

**Regulatory Compliance:**
This policy is designed to comply with applicable privacy laws including GDPR, CCPA, and other regional privacy regulations. For region-specific rights and procedures, please refer to our main Privacy Policy.

**Dispute Resolution:**
If you have concerns about our fingerprinting practices that we cannot resolve, you may contact your local data protection authority or {{DISPUTE_RESOLUTION}}.
